    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>ENDALOR</strong> is a medieval dark fantasy survival game with RPG elements for 1-4 players. Explore, survive, build, craft, fight and conquer your way through the dark, brutal and mysterious land of Endalor. <br>Explore, survive and conquer the world of Endalor. Fight your way through inhabitants of this dark fantasy world and its even darker undergrounds. Scavenge for resources, trade, build your home and craft finest gear. Become allies with the rulers of this Land or become the one they fear the most. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/828e925fc47a520bc2f729c4419d8b12.poster.avif?t=1754054526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/828e925fc47a520bc2f729c4419d8b12.webm?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/828e925fc47a520bc2f729c4419d8b12.mp4?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A vast hand crafted open world seamlessly full of secrets and dangers that is connected from huge mountains and castles to dark dungeons and darker caverns. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/bdb77e589f016a5e5fc4e9bfb39117d0.poster.avif?t=1754054526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/bdb77e589f016a5e5fc4e9bfb39117d0.webm?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/bdb77e589f016a5e5fc4e9bfb39117d0.mp4?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </li><li>Gather resources provided by the land or take them form the bodies of your enemies, scavenge ancient dungeons and castles for loot and treasure. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/01320e746667db7402e23f944381aeaa.poster.avif?t=1754054526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/01320e746667db7402e23f944381aeaa.webm?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/01320e746667db7402e23f944381aeaa.mp4?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </li><li>Unforgiving stamina based combat system that will test even the strongest knights. Smash, swing, slash, dodge and roll, rain arrows and cast ancient spells to defeat ancient enemies. </li><li>Build a small camp or a mighty fortress. Craft weapons, armor, tools, workstations, fortifications and house decorations. </li><li> Play with up to 4 players or alone in single player mode.  </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>ENDALOR</strong> is a medieval dark fantasy survival game with RPG elements for 1-4 players. Explore, survive, build, craft, fight and conquer your way through the dark, brutal and mysterious land of Endalor. <br>Explore, survive and conquer the world of Endalor. Fight your way through inhabitants of this dark fantasy world and its even darker undergrounds. Scavenge for resources, trade, build your home and craft finest gear. Become allies with the rulers of this Land or become the one they fear the most. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/828e925fc47a520bc2f729c4419d8b12.poster.avif?t=1754054526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/828e925fc47a520bc2f729c4419d8b12.webm?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/828e925fc47a520bc2f729c4419d8b12.mp4?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A vast hand crafted open world seamlessly full of secrets and dangers that is connected from huge mountains and castles to dark dungeons and darker caverns. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/bdb77e589f016a5e5fc4e9bfb39117d0.poster.avif?t=1754054526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/bdb77e589f016a5e5fc4e9bfb39117d0.webm?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/bdb77e589f016a5e5fc4e9bfb39117d0.mp4?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </li><li>Gather resources provided by the land or take them form the bodies of your enemies, scavenge ancient dungeons and castles for loot and treasure. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/01320e746667db7402e23f944381aeaa.poster.avif?t=1754054526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/01320e746667db7402e23f944381aeaa.webm?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265990/extras/01320e746667db7402e23f944381aeaa.mp4?t=1754054526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </li><li>Unforgiving stamina based combat system that will test even the strongest knights. Smash, swing, slash, dodge and roll, rain arrows and cast ancient spells to defeat ancient enemies. </li><li>Build a small camp or a mighty fortress. Craft weapons, armor, tools, workstations, fortifications and house decorations. </li><li> Play with up to 4 players or alone in single player mode.  </li></ul>",
